# "When Dain enters, create ... Axe ... When you do, attach it to target creature you control": Bot1 aims the reflexive trigger at the first
# Ornithopter, not at Dain, so it is 1/2 with the Axe (+1/+0), Dain stays 1/4 and the second Ornithopter 0/2. On turn 3 all three attack:
# "each equipped attacking creature gains double strike" - only the equipped Ornithopter has it (Keywords checked beside the unequipped
# controls). Damage: 1 x 2 (Ornithopter, double strike) + 1 (Dain) + 0 = 3, so Bot2 is at 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Dáin Ironfoot
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
